      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Bolota. Para expandir seu habitat, Seedot finge ser uma noz e deixa que Pokémon pássaro o carreguem para longe. Ele vive pendurado nos galhos das árvores, absorvendo sua umidade. Grandes fileiras desses Pokémon podem ser vistas em árvores jovens e altas.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/4 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo, Grama &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Seedot pode evoluir para Nuzleaf no nível 5 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Absorb, Bide, Harden, Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Astonish</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Growth</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Rollout</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Mega Drain, Nature Power</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Payback</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Headbutt, Synthesis</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Sunny Day</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Sucker Punch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Explosion</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Amnesia, Attract, Beat Up, Body Slam, Bullet Seed, Confide, Curse, Defog, Dig, Double Team, Double-Edge, Endeavor, Endure, Energy Ball, Explosion, Facade, False Swipe, Foul Play, Frustration, Giga Drain, Grass Knot, Grassy Glide, Grassy Terrain, Hidden Power, Leaf Storm, Magical Leaf, Nasty Plot, Nature Power, Payback, Power Swap, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Retaliate, Return, Round, Seed Bomb, Self-Destruct, Shadow Ball, Sleep Talk, Snore, Solar Beam, Spite, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swords Dance, Synthesis, Take Down, Tera Blast, Toxic, Trailblaze, Worry Seed</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Amnesia, Beat Up, Bullet Seed, Defog, Foul Play, Grassy Terrain, Leech Seed, Nasty Plot, Night Slash, Power Swap, Quick Attack, Razor Wind, Take Down, Worry Seed</p>",
